1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,240
=Episode 14=

2
00:00:11,446 --> 00:00:12,208
What?

3
00:00:12,895 --> 00:00:14,228
Isn't he still unmarried?

4
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:21,504
We fell in love at first sight.

5
00:00:21,542 --> 00:00:23,752
But that old emperor tore us apart.

6
00:00:52,628 --> 00:00:54,037
That's so touching.

7
00:00:54,037 --> 00:00:55,637
So touching.

8
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:57,428
I didn't know the two of you

9
00:00:58,038 --> 00:01:00,209
had such a moving love story.

10
00:01:00,514 --> 00:01:01,161
Mm-hmm.

11
00:01:03,104 --> 00:01:04,780
Oh, this is all my fault.

12
00:01:05,238 --> 00:01:06,000
I was wrong.

13
00:01:06,113 --> 00:01:07,446
I shouldn't have split you up.

14
00:01:07,446 --> 00:01:08,446
Mm-hmm.

15
00:01:10,380 --> 00:01:11,219
I've decided.

16
00:01:12,704 --> 00:01:14,266
If the old emperor won't let you marry,

17
00:01:14,419 --> 00:01:15,256
I'll arrange your wedding myself.

18
00:01:15,256 --> 00:01:16,057
Great.

19
00:01:22,532 --> 00:01:23,600
What?

20
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:37,046
Liuyue.

21
00:01:37,619 --> 00:01:38,914
Maybe we should call it off.

22
00:01:39,065 --> 00:01:39,560
Liuyue.

23
00:01:39,790 --> 00:01:42,380
I don't think this marriage is right.

24
00:01:43,142 --> 00:01:44,019
Of course it is.

25
00:01:44,209 --> 00:01:45,428
Why wouldn't it be?

26
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,485
I checked the almanac.

27
00:01:47,561 --> 00:01:49,008
Today is auspicious for weddings

28
00:01:49,008 --> 00:01:49,770
and inauspicious for calling one off.

29
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:50,570
Come on.

30
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:51,599
But I...

31
00:01:51,599 --> 00:01:53,200
No more buts.

32
00:01:54,076 --> 00:01:55,408
People in love

33
00:01:55,408 --> 00:01:57,846
should cherish every second

34
00:01:58,152 --> 00:01:59,333
and have the courage to be together.

35
00:01:59,866 --> 00:02:00,819
If you miss your chance...

36
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,219
I...

37
00:02:05,618 --> 00:02:07,180
I'm afraid you'll end up like me

38
00:02:07,409 --> 00:02:08,360
and regret it forever.

39
00:02:09,275 --> 00:02:10,457
Regret it forever?

40
00:02:16,857 --> 00:02:17,465
Xi Yuan.

41
00:02:17,846 --> 00:02:18,837
Do you know

42
00:02:18,837 --> 00:02:20,095
why I wanted Jin Yunlie

43
00:02:20,095 --> 00:02:21,085
to be my captive spouse?

44
00:02:23,219 --> 00:02:24,438
Because...

45
00:02:25,809 --> 00:02:26,989
he looks just like someone from my past.

46
00:02:28,285 --> 00:02:29,580
After I came to Zhongtu,

47
00:02:29,885 --> 00:02:31,065
I met Eryue.

48
00:02:32,095 --> 00:02:33,314
The moment I saw him,

49
00:02:33,961 --> 00:02:35,066
I fell in love with him.

50
00:02:36,246 --> 00:02:37,009
Eryue.

51
00:02:38,951 --> 00:02:39,866
I like you.

52
00:02:40,095 --> 00:02:41,541
I want to be with you forever.

53
00:02:42,723 --> 00:02:43,219
Liuyue,

54
00:02:43,790 --> 00:02:45,542
I've only ever thought of you...

55
00:02:49,085 --> 00:02:50,190
as a friend.

56
00:03:05,847 --> 00:03:06,608
I know

57
00:03:07,180 --> 00:03:08,971
he must've had feelings for me too.

58
00:03:12,437 --> 00:03:13,580
Sadly,

59
00:03:14,952 --> 00:03:17,084
we never got to tell each other
how we felt.

60
00:03:17,732 --> 00:03:19,600
You never got the chance?

61
00:03:24,970 --> 00:03:25,732
He died.

62
00:03:29,657 --> 00:03:30,951
Right before my eyes.

63
00:03:32,437 --> 00:03:33,503
Not even his remains were left.

64
00:03:39,789 --> 00:03:40,703
Eryue.

65
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:07,760
♪I shut out the world, you're all I see♪

66
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:10,960
♪One glance to last forever,
just you and me♪

67
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:13,120
♪Though deep in bone this longing stays♪

68
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,160
♪A few more glances cast♪

69
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:17,040
♪An everlasting love to hold,
forever made to last♪

70
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:20,720
♪After the world fades away,
you alone stay in my sight♪

71
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:24,680
♪Rouge sachets and jade towers
can't match your dance in the light♪

72
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:27,485
♪Once the heart knows love's design,
it's you I seek, and intertwine♪

73
00:04:27,485 --> 00:04:28,741
I can't forget him.

74
00:04:29,694 --> 00:04:30,990
I sought out countless men.

75
00:04:31,295 --> 00:04:32,704
Every one of them resembled him,

76
00:04:32,970 --> 00:04:34,152
but none of them was him.

77
00:04:34,456 --> 00:04:35,676
I'd marry one, then let him go,

78
00:04:35,980 --> 00:04:37,161
only to marry another.

79
00:04:37,694 --> 00:04:38,838
But in the end,

80
00:04:39,103 --> 00:04:40,170
all I ever sought

81
00:04:40,589 --> 00:04:42,000
was only a shadow of him.

82
00:04:52,780 --> 00:04:53,542
Xi Yuan.

83
00:04:54,609 --> 00:04:55,980
I actually envy you.

84
00:04:56,209 --> 00:04:58,304
You still have a chance
to be with the one you love.

85
00:04:58,760 --> 00:04:59,904
You're truly lucky.

86
00:05:02,647 --> 00:05:03,408
Liuyue.

87
00:05:04,513 --> 00:05:05,504
Thank you.

88
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,361
All right.

89
00:05:09,009 --> 00:05:10,418
It's getting late.

90
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:11,560
I'll get going.

91
00:05:11,980 --> 00:05:13,884
Just wait here for your groom.

92
00:05:21,238 --> 00:05:21,809
Yellow Dragon.

93
00:05:22,304 --> 00:05:23,332
You did nothing wrong.

94
00:05:23,941 --> 00:05:24,971
We had no choice

95
00:05:25,237 --> 00:05:26,342
but to oppose him.

96
00:05:27,370 --> 00:05:28,133
That's right.

97
00:05:29,314 --> 00:05:30,380
We had no choice.

98
00:05:31,295 --> 00:05:34,304
Because deities aren't allowed to love.

99
00:05:34,609 --> 00:05:36,209
So even the one we love most...

100
00:05:37,123 --> 00:05:38,000
We can't even

101
00:05:38,533 --> 00:05:39,941
hold her hand.

102
00:05:41,503 --> 00:05:43,103
When will this absurd fate

103
00:05:44,095 --> 00:05:45,884
finally come to an end?

104
00:05:57,047 --> 00:05:57,808
(Xi Yuan.)

105
00:05:59,561 --> 00:06:00,665
(Don't let your inner demon trap you.)

106
00:06:02,647 --> 00:06:03,332
(Follow me.)

107
00:06:30,075 --> 00:06:33,009
They actually went all the way
to Zhongtu to get married.

108
00:06:33,771 --> 00:06:36,514
Have you completed
the task I assigned you?

109
00:06:37,313 --> 00:06:37,922
Your Majesty,

110
00:06:38,341 --> 00:06:39,447
on the night of the Lantern Festival,

111
00:06:39,561 --> 00:06:41,122
the curse planted inside Xi Yuan

112
00:06:41,618 --> 00:06:43,180
has seeped into her soul and bloodline.

113
00:06:43,180 --> 00:06:44,438
Once you give the order to activate it,

114
00:06:44,589 --> 00:06:45,580
she'll die.

115
00:06:49,923 --> 00:06:50,418
All right.

116
00:06:50,646 --> 00:06:51,560
You may leave.

117
00:06:53,884 --> 00:06:55,676
I killed you once,

118
00:06:55,827 --> 00:06:57,580
I can kill you a second time.

119
00:06:58,609 --> 00:07:00,438
How do you expect to fight me?

120
00:07:31,256 --> 00:07:32,018
What happened?

121
00:07:33,314 --> 00:07:34,495
She just tried to kill herself.

122
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,599
That's impossible.

123
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,657
According to my prediction,

124
00:07:37,657 --> 00:07:38,989
she wasn't fated
to face this tribulation.

125
00:07:40,703 --> 00:07:41,580
Even I couldn't restore

126
00:07:42,190 --> 00:07:43,790
her divine sense just now.

127
00:07:44,438 --> 00:07:45,122
I suspect

128
00:07:45,846 --> 00:07:47,980
an otherworldly force is acting on her.

129
00:07:48,552 --> 00:07:49,314
Yellow Dragon.

130
00:07:49,733 --> 00:07:50,646
Guard me while I do this.

131
00:07:51,333 --> 00:07:52,285
I need to examine her.

132
00:07:52,932 --> 00:07:53,694
All right.

133
00:08:43,294 --> 00:08:44,057
Shisi.

134
00:08:45,352 --> 00:08:46,114
What happened?

135
00:08:46,646 --> 00:08:48,133
Why are you so drained?

136
00:08:48,437 --> 00:08:49,503
It's the Seven Killings Curse.

137
00:08:49,809 --> 00:08:50,799
The Seven Killings Curse?

138
00:08:51,484 --> 00:08:53,541
Isn't that a curse
only deities can cast?

139
00:08:54,038 --> 00:08:55,408
It's an extremely vicious curse.

140
00:08:56,856 --> 00:08:58,228
Once it takes root in the body,

141
00:08:58,342 --> 00:08:59,676
it drains the victim's life.

142
00:09:00,133 --> 00:09:01,200
Divine law states

143
00:09:01,770 --> 00:09:02,609
that deities may not harm

144
00:09:02,609 --> 00:09:04,475
the people of the Lower Xuanji Realm.

145
00:09:04,932 --> 00:09:05,922
Who could've done this?

146
00:09:07,713 --> 00:09:09,085
Who wants Xi Yuan dead

147
00:09:09,694 --> 00:09:10,723
more than anyone else?

148
00:09:14,685 --> 00:09:15,675
The Huyun Deity?

149
00:09:18,418 --> 00:09:19,904
We've spent nine lifetimes
searching for him.

150
00:09:20,894 --> 00:09:22,456
Now he's finally revealed himself.

151
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,666
That's for the best.

152
00:09:25,466 --> 00:09:26,800
Now that he's out in the open,

153
00:09:27,332 --> 00:09:29,200
he won't get another chance
to hurt Xi Yuan.

154
00:10:15,880 --> 00:10:19,080
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit♪

155
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:22,400
♪The envy of everyone♪

156
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:26,240
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions♪

157
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:29,520
♪Leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

158
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:32,520
♪No matter how long or hard our road♪

159
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:35,440
♪I don't care♪

160
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:39,800
♪But you left me with this pain♪

161
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:44,480
♪Forever beyond redemption♪
